<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Contact Us - Krishna National Contest 2026</title>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e3f2fd 0%, #bbdefb 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a237e 0%, #283593 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 60px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .header::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 30px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0;
        }

        .header-icon {
            font-size: 56px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            animation: bounce 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes bounce {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 36px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .header p {
            font-size: 18px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 50px 50px 60px;
        }

        .intro-text {
            text-align: center;
            color: #37474f;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .contact-cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .contact-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.1) 0%, rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.05) 100%);
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .contact-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .contact-card-icon {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .contact-card h3 {
            color: #1a237e;
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .contact-card p {
            color: #37474f;
            font-size: 16px;
            word-break: break-word;
        }

        .contact-card a {
            color: #1a237e;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .contact-card a:hover {
            color: #ffd700;
        }

        .info-section {
            background: rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.08);
            border-left: 4px solid #2196f3;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .info-section h3 {
            color: #1a237e;
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .info-section h3::before {
            content: '⏱️';
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        .info-section p {
            color: #37474f;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .back-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: #1a237e;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            background: rgba(26, 35, 126, 0.08);
            border-radius: 30px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .back-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(26, 35, 126, 0.15);
            transform: translateX(-5px);
        }

        .footer-note {
            text-align: center;
            color: #78909c;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .content, .header {
                padding: 40px 30px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 28px;
            }

            .contact-cards {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            body {
                padding: 20px 15px;
            }

            .content, .header {
                padding: 30px 25px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }

            .header-icon {
                font-size: 42px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <a href="/" class="back-btn">← Back to Home</a>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="header-icon">📞</div>
            <h1>Contact Us</h1>
            <p>We're here to help you</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <div class="intro-text">
                <p>
                    Have questions about registration, payment, or submission? 
                    Our support team is ready to assist you with any queries regarding the Krishna National Contest.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="contact-cards">
                <div class="contact-card">
                    <div class="contact-card-icon">📧</div>
                    <h3>Email Support</h3>
                    <p><a href="mailto:support@krishnacontest.org">support@krishnacontest.org</a></p>
                </div>

                <div class="contact-card">
                    <div class="contact-card-icon">📱</div>
                    <h3>Phone Support</h3>
                    <p><a href="tel:+91XXXXXXXXXX">+91-XXXXXXXXXX</a></p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="info-section">
                <h3>Response Time</h3>
                <p>
                    We strive to respond to all inquiries within <strong>24-48 hours</strong> during business days. 
                    For urgent matters, please mention "URGENT" in your email subject line.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="info-section" style="border-left-color: #4caf50; background: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.08);">
                <h3 style="color: #2e7d32;">Best Time to Reach</h3>
                <p>
                    Our support team is available <strong>Monday to Saturday</strong>, from 
                    <strong>9:00 AM to 6:00 PM IST</strong>. We're closed on Sundays and public holidays.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-note">
                <p>© 2026 Krishna National Contest. All Rights Reserved.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
